XSbvUHHaYlDq4Q3YcHCLIBKAA"]],1],null,null,"等待時間",null,"0ahUKEwjzmKjWsteWAxXSbvUHHaYlDq4Q3IcHCLEBKAw",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["料理就中品中級。還算好吃，但也沒有專程來的程度。\n整體風格 包含品類、裝潢、酒飲是很像日本家常食堂，料理本身風格則很台。\n\n干貝扁食拉麵，滿明顯的台灣口味的擔擔麵，就很居家生活的口味。\n日式炸雞：裹薄粉的市場炸雞口味，有醃有入味，口味還不錯。\n煎餃：就普通好吃的煎餃。\n小黃瓜：特殊風味，好不好吃要看個人風格，是對我味的，有來可嘗試。\n泡菜：我有點跟愛之味罐頭泡菜的風味搞混。應該是碰巧風味接近。\n這是台灣拉麵，菜是台灣口味，跟日本不二家餅乾無關。\n最日本拉麵店最接近的是裝潢、擺飾、跟擁擠程度。",null,[0,60]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/15659007395945041493/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBPUzJSWFJuTk9SekZIWTFkS1dGWXpjRTlQVmtFeVVrVTFWRmRyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15659007395945041493/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBPUzJSWFJuTk9SekZIWTFkS1dGWXpjRTlQVmtFeVVrVTFWRmRyUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/15659007395945041493/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBPUzJSWFJuTk9SekZIWTFkS1dGWXpjRTlQVmtFeVVrVTFWRmRyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15659007395945041493/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBPUzJSWFJuTk9SekZIWTFkS1dGWXpjRTlQVmtFeVVrVTFWRmRyUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/15659007395945041493/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBPUzJSWFJuTk9SekZIWTFkS1dGWXpjRTlQVmtFeVVrVTFWRmRyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15659007395945041493/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBPUzJSWFJuTk9SekZIWTFkS1dGWXpjRTlQVmtFeVVrVTFWRmRyUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,23883,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pOS2RXRnNORzFHY1dKWFYzcE9PVkEyUkU1VFdrRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x86bc9d6de5b4a54f!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjNKdWFsNG1GcWJXV3pOOVA2RE5TWkE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pOS2RXRnNO