，但吃得飽、吃得舒服，價格也很合理。\n\n這次用餐點了幾道餐點，簡單分享一下心得：\n•\t扁食湯：湯頭清爽，餛飩皮薄餡多，搭配海帶和蔬菜，喝起來很暖胃，味道偏淡，適合當開胃湯品。\n•\t炸雞咖哩飯：咖哩是偏家常風味，不是重香料派，唐揚雞外酥內嫩、保有肉汁，份量不少，炸物控可以點。\n•\t牛肉烏龍麵：湯頭比較普通，整體走台式家常感，吃完有飽足感，但沒有特別記憶點。\n•\t炸豬排咖哩飯：豬排炸得酥脆不油膩，厚度適中，咖哩口味樸實，適合日常簡單吃飯，不會有負擔。\n•\t煎餃：這次最喜歡的一道小菜，外皮煎得酥脆，內餡多汁，調味適中，搭配沾醬很加分，是整餐裡 CP 值最高的品項。\n\n整體來說，不二家是屬於那種「肚子餓想吃個簡單、平價、吃得飽」的好選擇。沒有浮誇的擺盤或創意料理，但味道穩定，價格實惠，份量充足。\n\n很適合家庭聚餐、學生族群，或是平日想快速解決一餐、不想踩雷的時候來吃。",null,[0,80]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/15659007395945041493/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVUkphRFptY21SUkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15659007395945041493/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVUkphRFptY21SUkVBRRAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/15659007395945041493/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVUkphRFptY21SUkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15659007395945041493/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVUkphRFptY21SUkVBRRAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/15659007395945041493/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVUkphRFptY21SUkVBRRAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15659007395945041493/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiNDaFpEU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblRVUkphRFptY21SUkVBRRAA"]],[null,null,24036,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURJaDZmcmRREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x86bc9d6de5b4a54f!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgMDIh6frdQ%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURJaDZmcmRREAE\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURJaDZmcmRREi4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdNREloNmZyOVFFEhNDZ3dJeGNqdXZ3WVF3SVc3d3dFGi0KFkNJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdNREloNmZyRFESE0Nnd0l4Y2p1dndZUXdJVzd3d0UiEgkAAAAAAAAAABFPpbTlbZ28hioLMGJ5dUc0TlFnQS0\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjzmKjWsteWAxXSbvUHHaYlDq4QoykI_gEoDQ"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwjT1q